     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "7. Since the signs of the numbers match, the division results in a positive number."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {-77} \\right) \\div \\left( {-11} \\right)\\ {\\rm{ is }}\\ 7\"></span>.</p>\n<p>Because –77 and –11 have the same sign, the quotient is positive.</p>"
    }
